    "detailed_description": "A beat 'em up side scrolling arcade game.<br />\r\nControl a group of 4 unusual bounty hunters on a mission to defeat the biggest criminals in the region.<br />\r\nThere's no secret, walk to the right and defeat everyone who stands in your way.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n- 4 unique controllable characters<br />\r\n- Can switch between them mid-combat<br />\r\n- 4 player multiplayer local that can join and leave the game at any time (Requires a controller)<br />\r\n- 6 stages<br />\r\n- 4 bosses (1 secret)",
